{"ref":"BDB, יָבֵשׁ³","hw":"יָבֵשׁ³","html":"† III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵישׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> et <strong>pers. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵשׁ גִּלְעָד</span> <em>Jabesh of Gilead</em>, 𝔊 Ιαβ(ε)ις Γαλααδ, exact site uknown, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:8\" href=\"/Judges.21.8\">Ju 21:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:9\" href=\"/Judges.21.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:10\" href=\"/Judges.21.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:12\" href=\"/Judges.21.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:14\" href=\"/Judges.21.14\">14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.12\">2 S 21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.11\">1 Ch 10:11</a> (𝔊L Ιαβις τῆς Γαλααδ); <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵישׁ גִּלְעָד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.1\">1 S 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.11\">31:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.4\">2 S 2:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.5\">5</a> (in these three 𝔊L Ιαβις τῆς Γαλαατίδιτος); <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.1\">1 S 11:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 11:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.11.10\">10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">1 Ch 10:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵ֑ישָׁה</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.12\">12</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵ֫שָׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.12\">1 S 31:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.13\">13</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n